flowchart LR
  A[Audience and stage] --> B[Template or sequence choice]
  B --> C[Verified trigger, offer, proof, and CTA]
  C --> D[Draft email]
  D --> E{Human review needed?}
  E -->|Yes| F[Revise before sending]
  E -->|No| G[Ready-to-send copy]
